[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0000","text":"便签"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0010","text":"糟了，糟了，再不出发就要迟到了……\n会议，我先走了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0020","text":"那个，桌子，\n……可以收拾一下吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0030","text":"啊……抱歉\n弄得乱七八糟的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0040","text":"文具和文件之类的，\n该放哪里好呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0050","text":"先放那边的柜子就行！\n我回来再放回原位"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0060","text":"匆匆忙忙的真不好意思！\n回来一定好好谢你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0062","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0070","text":"…………？\n这本杂志…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0080","text":"『圆香份　※可自由带走』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0090","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_12100200_03_0100","text":"……"}]
